__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store

# Evaluation run artifacts.
#
# Runs live at <skill>/runs/<experiment>/ (a skill subdirectory), so patterns
# are matched with a leading **/ to work regardless of install depth. Each run
# writes two kinds of output:
#   - per-experiment SUMMARIES at the run root (small, human/machine-readable,
#     worth committing as citable evidence):
#         <skill>/runs/<experiment>/report.md         human-readable outcome
#         <skill>/runs/<experiment>/experiment.json   machine-readable record
#   - per-TRIAL artifacts under trials/ (large, regenerable, machine-only:
#     copied fixtures, worker traces, git patches, per-judge grader output).
#
# Ignore only the per-trial bulk. The summaries sit at the run root (not under
# trials/), so they stay tracked automatically — no negation needed.
**/runs/*/trials/

# Comparison summaries (v1-vs-v2 result reports) are small and citable — keep
# them tracked. To ignore them instead, uncomment the next line.
# **/comparisons/
